94139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433500 1083 #uuid "1c1b9805-9295-5f1f-93ad-1b87d622dbf3" 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433501 1080 "The critical points lie on the line $v=u.$" 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433501 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433501 1083 #uuid "2794a3de-45e3-5d1c-aaa5-e06f453a2bb3" 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433502 1080 "The only critical point is $(1,2).$" 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433502 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433502 1083 #uuid "c9eec4e3-df6c-5bff-a85a-74dee074332e" 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433503 1075 #edb/ref 17592186433498 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433503 1075 #edb/ref 17592186433499 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433503 1075 #edb/ref 17592186433500 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433503 1075 #edb/ref 17592186433501 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433503 1075 #edb/ref 17592186433502 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433503 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433503 1077 "selection" 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433503 1078 #edb/ref 17592186433502 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433503 1079 #uuid "58f46da7-c0a4-56d1-b636-f9591428aeed" 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433504 1068 #edb/ref 17592186433503 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433504 1069 "q-160476" 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433504 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433504 1071 "Find the locations of all of the critical points of the transformation $T,$ where $T$ is defined as\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}(u-1)^{3}-(v-2)^{3} \\\\ u+v\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433504 1072 #uuid "9ffd9297-ce86-5e32-becf-cbd84b607c09" 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433504 1074 "Given a transformation \n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]\\to [\\begin{aligned}x(u,v) \\\\ y(u,v)\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nthe Jacobian determinant of $T,$ denoted $\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)},$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the locations of the critical points of $T,$ we need to solve \n\n$$\n\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}=0.\n$$\n\nHere, we have $x(u,v)=(u-1)^{3}-(v-2)^{3}$ and $y(u,v)=u+v.$  \n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & =3(u-1)^{2} & \\,\\frac{∂x}{∂v} & =-3(v-2)^{2} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & =1 & \\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the corresponding Jacobian determinant is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}3(u-1)^{2} & -3(v-2)^{2} \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3(u-1)^{2}\\cdot 1-(-3(v-2)^{2})\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =3(u-1)^{2}+3(v-2)^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe function has critical points when $\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}=0.$ So, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =0 \\\\ 3(u-1)^{2}+3(v-2)^{2} & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe equation $3(u-1)^{2}+3(v-2)^{2}=0$ defines the point $(1,2)$ in the $uv$-plane." 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433505 1062 #uuid "2829a17c-8a17-5054-a69a-9c845f86a147" 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433505 1063 #edb/ref 17592186433504 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433506 1058 #edb/ref 17592186433505 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433506 1062 #uuid "552040e6-e34a-5420-b715-153752988504" 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433506 1063 #edb/ref 17592186199003 13194139534707 17592186045417 true] [17592186433507 1058 #edb/ref 17592